    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so exhausting. honestly, even the help people talk about feels like more noise. how am i supposed to \"move forward\" when my whole life is just a shell of what it was? it feels like i'm just performing being alive for no one. there's no version of the future where this doesn't just feel empty and hollow. everything just feels so final.",
